@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #526d76

start
:Receive one immutable ScheduleFacts
(clock snapshot + one group per schedule);
:Stage clock gate
(gap, trust, recovery checks);
:For each prelude entry, in dependency order:
evaluate once against old state
and already staged projections;
note right
  More than one newly crossed
  occurrence for a schedule:
  record all missed, execute none
end note
:Run transitions and intents
(read staged prelude entries);
if (Every fallible expression succeeded?) then (yes)
  :Commit together: windows, clock state,
  occurrence consumption, schedule
  observations, scalar state;
  :TickRecord keeps facts and decisions;
else (no)
  :Discard every candidate;
  :Retry later sees the same crossing;
endif
stop
@enduml
